# --- Supabase (optional — not required for local demo) ---
# When both are set, src/lib/supabase.ts creates a client and src/data
# selects the remote adapter. Zustand remains the default without these keys.
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# --- Later: Apple Sign-In ---
# Configure in app.json / Apple Developer + expo-apple-authentication
# EXPO_PUBLIC_APPLE_SERVICE_ID=

# Local demo uses Zustand + AsyncStorage — no keys needed to run.
